---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Coyote & Quill — Advisory · Strategy · Build"
  description="Coyote & Quill delivers AI adoption strategy, executive communications, and custom application development. Observe. Assess. Advise."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-layout">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">
          <span class="label">Est. 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Precision strategy<br />for <em>consequential</em> problems.</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          Coyote &amp; Quill delivers AI adoption strategy, executive communications, and custom application development — with the discipline of a combat advisor and the craft of a practitioner.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-motto" aria-label="Firm motto">
          <span>Observe</span>
          <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span>Assess</span>
          <div class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <span>Advise</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/services" class="btn btn-primary">View Services</a>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">About the Firm</a>
        </div>
      </div>
        <div class="hero-seal" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/assets/logo/cq-seal-02.svg" alt="" width="400" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="label">What We Do</p>
        <h2>Three service lines. One workshop.<br />One mandate: outcomes.</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>We don't sell subscriptions or generic frameworks. We take on a small number of engagements and go deep. Every engagement produces something the client keeps using after we leave.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-4">
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">01</p>
          <h3>AI Adoption &amp; Integration</h3>
          <p>Assess your actual capability state, identify where AI creates compounding value, build the integration architecture, and train the people who have to live with it.</p>
          <a href="/services#ai-adoption">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">02</p>
          <h3>Thought Leadership &amp; Communications</h3>
          <p>Executives who cannot articulate their strategy lose the room. We help leaders communicate with precision — to boards, clients, regulators, and their own teams.</p>
          <a href="/services#communications">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">03</p>
          <h3>Custom App Development</h3>
          <p>Advice without implementation is just a memo. We build custom applications — web-based, AI-augmented, and built to last — that operationalize the strategies we recommend.</p>
          <a href="/services#app-dev">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="card-number">04</p>
          <h3>Vibe Coding Workshop</h3>
          <p>AI collapsed the distance between an idea and working software. We run hands-on workshops where your team builds a real, deployable tool with AI — in the room, on your stack.</p>
          <a href="/services#vibe-coding">Learn more →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div>
          <p class="label">Why Coyote &amp; Quill</p>
          <h2>The credentials are not borrowed.</h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>Retired United States Marine Corps AH-1W Cobra pilot. TTECG Coyote. Combat advisor to Mongolian, Georgian, and Japanese military forces. AI adoption practitioner building and deploying systems at a healthcare startup — across product, operations, compliance, and customer success simultaneously.</p>
          <p>The military background is the foundation of the firm's value proposition: the ability to assess a situation accurately, strip out noise, and deliver a course of action that actually works.</p>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top: 8px;">Full Background →</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="highlight-box">
            <p>"Coyote &amp; Quill is not competing with McKinsey or Deloitte. The firm is competing with the absence of a credible, precision-oriented AI advisory option for organizations that cannot afford a Big Four retainer and cannot trust a generic boutique."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-top: 24px;">
            <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Proprietary Product</p>
            <h3>TraceWell</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Healthcare SaaS platform — the firm's flagship product and live demonstration of custom app development capability.</p>
            <span class="badge badge-active"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Active Development</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="text-align: center;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Work With Us</p>
      <h2 style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">Ready to observe, assess, and move?</h2>
      <p style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 40px;">We work with a small number of clients at a time. If you're navigating AI adoption, need to communicate complex strategy, or need something built — let's talk.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
